{"name": "Cold Contours: Intake", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This industrial megastructure was built to hold back the cold. Now the cold has swallowed it: the halls stand empty, almost all of its machinery has frozen under the ice, and only a few machines are still running.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cold Contours: Intake</strong> is an atmospheric first-person physics puzzle game about making your way through this megastructure to its very heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"488\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4742440/extras/bdd48462f284ebeef3b3fddde0872806.poster.avif?t=1790694527\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4742440/extras/bdd48462f284ebeef3b3fddde0872806.webm?t=1790694527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4742440/extras/bdd48462f284ebeef3b3fddde0872806.mp4?t=1790694527\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Two Cubes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At first, the claws of your exosuit hold nothing but two heavy cubes. Throw them to knock things down and jolt stuck mechanisms into motion, then call them back at any moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"488\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4742440/extras/3dfdc63ea70f43717a870ea5e5c56be8.poster.avif?t=1790694527\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4742440/extras/3dfdc63ea70f43717a870ea5e5c56be8.webm?t=1790694527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4742440/extras/3dfdc63ea70f43717a870ea5e5c56be8.mp4?t=1790694527\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Charge</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once charged, the cubes become electromagnets. They cling to metal and pull in anything that isn't bolted down, opening up new ways to shift objects and to get around the structure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"488\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4742440/extras/9e63b0bcbf4e0c99b6faa4fd6473fd52.poster.avif?t=1790694527\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4742440/extras/9e63b0bcbf4e0c99b6faa4fd6473fd52.webm?t=1790694527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4742440/extras/9e63b0bcbf4e0c99b6faa4fd6473fd52.mp4?t=1790694527\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Plus and Minus</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each magnet's polarity can be switched on its own. Opposite poles attract and like poles repel, so two magnets can push platforms apart, pull objects together and work machinery from a distance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"488\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4742440/extras/0fda4ccbe39c24b735501ac6c02a1393.poster.avif?t=1790694527\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4742440/extras/0fda4ccbe39c24b735501ac6c02a1393.webm?t=1790694527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4742440/extras/0fda4ccbe39c24b735501ac6c02a1393.mp4?t=1790694527\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Exosuit</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This exosuit was made for the workers who once kept this place from stopping, and everything you need to know is right on it. Glance down, and the gauges on your chest show your health and temperature. The claws haul you up onto ledges, and the power frame lets you jump far and land without a scratch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"488\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4742440/extras/43e4225ed269837b0ac89051e6254aae.poster.avif?t=1790694527\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4742440/extras/43e4225ed269837b0ac89051e6254aae.webm?t=1790694527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4742440/extras/43e4225ed269837b0ac89051e6254aae.mp4?t=1790694527\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "You find yourself inside a frozen industrial megastructure. Its corridors are silent, its machinery locked in ice. Yet the pipes still breathe steam, and something at its very heart is waiting. The path to it is a puzzle of ice and metal, but all you have is a pair of magnets.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4742440/c94b81e5740148251f16fbe266ce4d368df903b5/header.jpg?t=1790694527", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Adventure", "Puzzle Platformer", "Action", "Exploration", "Atmospheric", "Logic"], "developers": "Tactolith", "publishers": "Tactolith", "release_date": "2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4742440", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "1 October 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/YiOs12R5ZcI", "first_seen": 1790805600.0, "review_rank": 3}